# CI/CD, Security & Migrations

## CI (every PR)
lint → typecheck → test → build → Docker build. Do not skip checks.

## Branches
`feature/*` CI only · `develop`→dev · `release/*`→uat · `main`→prod (manual gate)

## Migrations
- Edit `prisma/schema.prisma` → `prisma migrate dev --name desc`
- Commit SQL + schema together; forward-fix preferred over rollback
- Prod: backup → `migrate deploy` → verify `/ready`

## OpenAPI
Update `openapi/sfa-api-v1.yaml` when adding/changing public endpoints.

## Security
- Rate limit `/token` and `/sync/push`
- RBAC guard every endpoint
- No secrets in code; tenant test on every new data module

## Approvals
Use generic ApprovalService — config per entityType, not duplicate queue logic.
